          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "CONCATENATE \nThe concatenate node combines multiple strings into a one string. The size (the amount of strings you want to combine) can be set in the inspector.\n\nExample:  Here we concatenate two strings into one before rendering it.\n"
